    </div>

    <div class="qblock" id="qb-11">
      <div class="qrow">
        <span class="qnum">11</span>
        <span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">11</strong><select class="q-select" name="practice_single_reading_50_11" id="practice_single_reading_50_11_" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 11">
          <option value="">—</option><option value="TRUE">TRUE</option><option value="FALSE">FALSE</option><option value="NOT GIVEN">NOT GIVEN</option>
        </select></span>
        <span class="qtext">Dolls made of celluloid tended to lose their colour.</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="qblock" id="qb-12">
      <div class="qrow">
        <span class="qnum">12</span>
        <span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">12</strong><select class="q-select" name="practice_single_reading_50_12" id="practice_single_reading_50_12_" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 12">
          <option value="">—</option><option value="TRUE">TRUE</option><option value="FALSE">FALSE</option><option value="NOT GIVEN">NOT GIVEN</option>
        </select></span>
        <span class="qtext">Composition dolls lasted longer than the plastic dolls that were made in the 1940s.</span>
