passage 1 (2).html"}]},"explanations":{"1":{"part":1,"en":"clay. In the paragraph about Egypt in 2000 BC, the dolls have wooden bodies and hair made of clay. The gap asks for the hair material, so choose clay, not wood.","uz":"loy. Miloddan avvalgi 2000-yildagi Misr haqidagi paragrafda qo'g'irchoqlarning yog'och tanasi va sochlari loydan qilingan. Bo'shliq soch materialini so'raydi, shuning uchun yog'ochni emas, balki loyni tanlang.","quotes":["'hair' made of clay"],"ru":"глина. В абзаце о Египте 2000 года до нашей эры у кукол деревянные тела и глиняные волосы. Зазор требует материала для волос, поэтому выбирайте глину, а не дерево.","translationProvenance":{"ru":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"8b7d871b4d16c69255390bfa35180ae91b64a2490eb6644f5c031fac46650e5f"},"uz":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"8b7d871b4d16c69255390bfa35180ae91b64a2490eb6644f5c031fac46650e5f"}}},"2":{"part":1,"en":"goddesses. The paragraph about ancient Greece and Rome says that older girls offered their wooden dolls to goddesses when they had outgrown playing with them. The gap asks who received the dolls.","uz":"ma'budalar. Qadimgi Yunoniston va Rim haqidagi paragrafda aytilishicha, katta yoshdagi qizlar o'zlarining yog'och qo'g'irchoqlarini ular bilan o'ynashdan oshib ketganlarida ma'budalarga taklif qilishgan. Bo'shliq qo'g'irchoqlarni kim olganini so'raydi.","quotes":["offered their wooden dolls to goddesses"],"ru":"богини. В абзаце о Древней Греции и Риме говорится, что девочки постарше предлагали богиням свои деревянные куклы, когда те переросли, играя с ними. Разрыв спрашивает, кто получил куклы.","translationProvenance":{"ru":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"550e0fe2e488e1107b381202d7c291fb403c3de4f91b10fcac1eb7376541aa47"},"uz":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"550e0fe2e488e1107b381202d7c291fb403c3de4f91b10fcac1eb7376541aa47"}}},"3":{"part":1,"en":"limbs. To make dolls lifelike, makers introduced movable limbs and removable garments by 600 BC. The question paraphrases movable as being put in different positions; garments means clothes.","uz":"oyoq-qo'llar. Qo'g'irchoqlarni jonli qilish uchun ishlab chiqaruvchilar miloddan avvalgi 600-yillarda harakatlanuvchi oyoq-qo'llari va olinadigan kiyimlarni taqdim etganlar. Savol turli o'rinlarda qo'yiladigan ko'chma so'zlarni ifodalaydi; kiyim-kechak, kiyim degani.","quotes":["movable limbs and removable garments"],"ru":"конечности. Чтобы сделать кукол реалистичными, к 600 г. до н.э. производители ввели подвижные конечности и съемную одежду. Вопрос перефразирует подвижное как находящееся в разных положениях; одежда означает одежду.","translationProvenance":{"ru":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"22ff162a3276007acf0b96edc9f17c5991733e6ece27164e13db922a60f752d2"},"uz":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"22ff162a3276007acf0b96edc9f17c5991733e6ece27164e13db922a60f752d2"}}},"4":{"part":1,"en":"wax. The paragraph on the 17th and 18th centuries says wax dolls grew in popularity. More common paraphrases grew in popularity, and the gap needs the material wax.","uz":"mum. 17 va 18-asrlardagi paragrafda mum qo'g'irchoqlarning mashhurligi oshgani aytiladi. Ko'proq keng tarqalgan parafrazlar mashhurlikka erishdi va bo'shliq moddiy mumga muhtoj.","quotes":["wax dolls grew in popularity in the 17th and 18th centuries"],"ru":"воск. В абзаце о 17 и 18 веках говорится, что популярность восковых кукол возросла. Популярность более распространенных фраз выросла, и для устранения пробела требуется материал-воск.","translationProvenance":{"ru":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"8452cdd6eb0d86c6c2f7decfd891a988ea23687573d59ae936bb4828f9e0d2f3"},"uz":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"8452cdd6eb0d86c6c2f7decfd891a988ea23687573d59ae936bb4828f9e0d2f3"}}},"5":{"part":1,"en":"plaster. The modeller first shaped a head in wax or clay, then covered it with plaster to create a mould. The gap asks about the mould, not the material later poured into it.","uz":"gips. Modeler avval boshni mum yoki loydan shakllantirdi, so'ngra qolip yaratish uchun uni gips bilan qopladi. Bo'shliq, keyinchalik unga quyilgan materialni emas, balki qolip haqida so'raydi.","quotes":["cover it with plaster to create a mould"],"ru":"штукатурка. Модельер сначала слепил голову из воска или глины, а затем покрыл ее гипсом, чтобы создать форму. Зазор спрашивает о форме, а не о материале, который позже в нее залили.","translationProvenance":{"ru":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"cc341da40ac7a3a43df37f1aa861cdaf3e075a58e67353d17451944b1443f0f8"},"uz":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"cc341da40ac7a3a43df37f1aa861cdaf3e075a58e67353d17451944b1443f0f8"}}},"6":{"part":1,"en":"composition. The paragraph beginning with Composition defines it as a collective term for mixtures of pulped wood or paper. It also mentions pressure moulding and secret recipes. These details match the notes; copy the one-word term composition.","uz":"tarkibi. Tarkibi bilan boshlangan paragraf uni yog'och yoki qog'oz massasi aralashmalari uchun umumiy atama sifatida belgilaydi. Shuningdek, u bosimli kalıplama va maxfiy retseptlar haqida gapiradi. Ushbu tafsilotlar eslatmalarga mos keladi; bir so‘zli atama kompozitsiyasini ko‘chiring.","quotes":["'Composition' is a collective term for mixtures of pulped wood or paper"],"ru":"состав. В абзаце, начинающемся со слова «Композиция», он определяется как собирательный термин для смесей целлюлозы из древесины или бумаги. Также упоминается литье под давлением и секретные рецепты. Эти детали соответствуют примечаниям; скопируйте состав термина из одного слова.","translationProvenance":{"ru":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"38ca3d9e1a82cca1214f19dbe4af5b095f317dcfeaeb96781b5abf46fa855d7c"},"uz":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"38ca3d9e1a82cca1214f19dbe4af5b095f317dcfeaeb96781b5abf46fa855d7c"}}},"7":{"part":1,"en":"FALSE. The porcelain paragraph says bisque looked more like skin than china did. More like skin means more realistic. The statement says bisque is less realistic, reversing the comparison, so it is FALSE.","uz":"FALSE. Chinni paragrafda aytilishicha, pechene chindan ko'ra teriga ko'proq o'xshaydi. Ko'proq teriga o'xshab, haqiqiyroq degan ma'noni anglatadi. Bayonotda aytilishicha, biskvit kamroq realistik, taqqoslashni o'zgartiradi, shuning uchun u FALSE.","quotes":["looked more like skin than china did"],"ru":"FALSE. В параграфе о фарфоре говорится, что бисквит больше похож на кожу, чем на фарфор. Больше похоже на кожу, значит, более реалистично. В заявлении говорится, что бисквит менее реалистичен, что меняет сравнение на противоположное, поэтому оно ЛОЖНО.","translationProvenance":{"ru":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"8099b3f640d8ffc88e77576e31636e2de935f40d894e9c80638387ad0d9199b5"},"uz":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"8099b3f640d8ffc88e77576e31636e2de935f40d894e9c80638387ad0d9199b5"}}},"8":{"part":1,"en":"TRUE. The paragraph about French and German dolls says German bisque dolls became popular because they were not as expensive. This means French dolls generally cost more, which agrees with the statement.","uz":"TRUE. Fransuz va nemis qo'g'irchoqlari haqidagi paragrafda aytilishicha, nemis pechene qo'g'irchoqlari qimmat bo'lmagani uchun mashhur bo'lgan. Bu shuni anglatadiki, frantsuz qo'g'irchoqlari odatda qimmatroq turadi, bu bayonotga mos keladi.","quotes":["German bisque dolls became quite popular because they were not as expensive"],"ru":"TRUE. В параграфе о французских и немецких куклах говорится, что немецкие куклы из бисквита стали популярными, потому что они были не такими дорогими. Это означает, что французские куклы обычно стоят дороже, что согласуется с утверждением.","translationProvenance":{"ru":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"3ba649ab0b1e723405361da927419a2bd318441f14999b0d91f2dab65e4f58b6"},"uz":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"3ba649ab0b1e723405361da927419a2bd318441f14999b0d91f2dab65e4f58b6"}}},"9":{"part":1,"en":"FALSE. Rag dolls had been made by mothers for many centuries. The 1850s date refers only to the first commercially produced rag dolls, not the first rag dolls of any kind. The statement confuses commercial production with their original creation.","uz":"FALSE. Ko'p asrlar davomida latta qo'g'irchoqlar onalar tomonidan yasalgan. 1850-yillar sanasi har qanday turdagi birinchi latta qo'g'irchoqlarga emas, balki faqat tijorat maqsadida ishlab chiqarilgan birinchi latta qo'g'irchoqlarga tegishli. Bayonot tijorat ishlab chiqarishni asl ijodi bilan aralashtirib yuboradi.","quotes":["For many centuries, rag dolls were made by mothers for their children."],"ru":"FALSE. Тряпичные куклы изготавливались матерями на протяжении многих веков. Дата 1850-х годов относится только к первым коммерческим тряпичным куклам, а не к первым тряпичным куклам любого типа. Заявление путает коммерческое производство с их оригинальным творением.","translationProvenance":{"ru":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"7b4c8300506ffdcb987b68bd75b09a283ce9f75633c0b9ae61dcad7f4633bee1"},"uz":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"7b4c8300506ffdcb987b68bd75b09a283ce9f75633c0b9ae61dcad7f4633bee1"}}},"10":{"part":1,"en":"TRUE. The text distinguishes rag dolls made of any fabric from the narrower category cloth dolls, made of linen or cotton. The statement uses the specific category cloth dolls and therefore agrees with this definition.","uz":"TRUE. Matn har qanday matodan qilingan latta qo'g'irchoqlarni zig'ir yoki paxtadan qilingan tor toifadagi mato qo'g'irchoqlaridan ajratib turadi. Bayonot maxsus toifadagi mato qo'g'irchoqlaridan foydalanadi va shuning uchun bu ta'rifga mos keladi.","quotes":["'Cloth doll' refers to a subset of rag dolls made of linen or cotton."],"ru":"TRUE. Текст отличает тряпичные куклы из любой ткани от более узкой категории тканевых кукол, изготовленных из льна или хлопка. В заявлении используются тканевые куклы конкретной категории, и поэтому оно согласуется с этим определением.","translationProvenance":{"ru":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"c777a21d80c9b468f858cbf41d1b541f11f50104a44610e3392bc68bd760e4fa"},"uz":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"c777a21d80c9b468f858cbf41d1b541f11f50104a44610e3392bc68bd760e4fa"}}},"11":{"part":1,"en":"TRUE. The celluloid paragraph describes its propensity to fade in bright light. Propensity means tendency, and fade means lose colour. This directly agrees with the statement.","uz":"TRUE. Selüloid paragraf uning yorqin nurda pasayish moyilligini tasvirlaydi. Moyillik moyillikni bildiradi, so'nish esa rangni yo'qotadi. Bu bayonotga to'g'ridan-to'g'ri mos keladi.","quotes":["propensity to fade in bright light"],"ru":"TRUE. Абзац о целлулоиде описывает его склонность к выцветанию при ярком свете. Склонность означает тенденцию, а выцветание означает потерю цвета. Это прямо согласуется с утверждением.","translationProvenance":{"ru":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"b53961d9703b61c23add2f5931f7a42ac0fd52f03450fbd69aa285c7978e898a"},"uz":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"b53961d9703b61c23add2f5931f7a42ac0fd52f03450fbd69aa285c7978e898a"}}},"12":{"part":1,"en":"FALSE. The final paragraph describes hard plastic dolls made in the 1940s: they resembled composition dolls but were much more durable. Durable means long-lasting. The statement reverses which type lasted longer.","uz":"FALSE. Oxirgi xatboshida 1940-yillarda ishlab chiqarilgan qattiq plastik qo'g'irchoqlar tasvirlangan: ular kompozitsion qo'g'irchoqlarga o'xshardi, lekin ancha bardoshli edi. Bardoshli degani uzoq umr degani. Bayonot qaysi tur uzoqroq davom etganini o'zgartiradi.","quotes":["They resembled composition dolls, but they were much more durable."],"ru":"FALSE. В последнем абзаце описываются куклы из твердого пластика, изготовленные в 1940-х годах: они напоминали композиционные куклы, но были гораздо более прочными. Прочный значит долговечный. Оператор меняет местами, какой тип просуществовал дольше.","translationProvenance":{"ru":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"40fe829d9e6cbee6029d24cdabe6aca380a8d17212fd7145f2768c92e67758b4"},"uz":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"40fe829d9e6cbee6029d24cdabe6aca380a8d17212fd7145f2768c92e67758b4"}}},"13":{"part":1,"en":"NOT GIVEN. The final paragraph mentions collectible dolls and the materials modern makers use. It does not state whether collectors prefer original clothing. There is no comparison of collectors' clothing preferences, so neither TRUE nor FALSE can be established.","uz":"NOT GIVEN. Yakuniy paragrafda yig'iladigan qo'g'irchoqlar va zamonaviy ishlab chiqaruvchilar foydalanadigan materiallar haqida so'z boradi. Unda kollektsionerlar asl kiyimlarni afzal ko'rishlari aytilmagan. Kollektorlarning kiyim-kechak afzalliklarini taqqoslash yo'q, shuning uchun na TRUE, na FALSE aniqlanishi mumkin emas.","quotes":["many modern doll makers are still using the traditional materials of the past to make collectible dolls."],"ru":"NOT GIVEN. В последнем абзаце упоминаются коллекционные куклы и материалы, которые используют современные производители. Не уточняется, предпочитают ли коллекционеры оригинальную одежду. Сравнения предпочтений коллекционеров в одежде не проводится, поэтому ни ПРАВДА, ни ЛОЖЬ не могут быть установлены.","translationProvenance":{"ru":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"3bea95652918dac92afff2ed79db6014fe41c67206e19ca2e91a99ddadaf49e1"},"uz":{"type":"machine-translation","sourceLanguage":"en","provider":"Google Translate","sourceSha256":"3bea95652918dac92afff2ed79db6014fe41c67206e19ca2e91a99ddadaf49e1"}}}}}]]
